WEBVTT

00:00:15.715 --> 00:00:22.745
Tell me
nanimo wakaranai no demo
Tell me
I don't understand anything, but

00:00:22.915 --> 00:00:29.915
You say
itsumo sonna kotoba mo
You always say
those kinds of words, too

00:00:30.895 --> 00:00:37.665
Surechigau dake no
You find another way
You find another way
where we only pass each other by

00:00:38.135 --> 00:00:44.805
Owatteku sekai wo tobidashite
You know?
And rush out into a world
that's ending, you know?

00:00:45.105 --> 00:00:50.635
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:00:50.915 --> 00:00:54.345
Hikari yori hayaku
Faster than light,

00:00:55.115 --> 00:00:59.145
monokuro no supiido de
with monochromic speed

00:00:59.425 --> 00:01:04.985
Hello Hello It's a New World
Hello, hello, it's a New World!

00:01:05.195 --> 00:01:08.755
Jikan yori tooku
Farther than time,

00:01:09.535 --> 00:01:14.295
kakenukeru
You're so far away
I run through it;
you're so far away

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:34.675
The Legend Begins

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:37.555
Death to player characters.

00:01:39.395 --> 00:01:42.335
Complete death to this world.

00:01:43.165 --> 00:01:44.025
No!

00:01:46.405 --> 00:01:48.025
Fireball Storm!

00:01:50.305 --> 00:01:52.135
Thunderbolt!

00:01:52.605 --> 00:01:54.595
Absolute Zero!

00:02:00.115 --> 00:02:02.415
Raining Rocks!

00:02:07.585 --> 00:02:11.325
W-why isn't it having any effect?

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:15.555
My rare costume!

00:02:16.095 --> 00:02:16.795
At this rate...

00:02:17.135 --> 00:02:19.035
...before we destroy it, we'll be...

00:02:19.735 --> 00:02:22.935
Sh-Shugo...

00:02:24.205 --> 00:02:24.935
You're...

00:02:25.675 --> 00:02:27.235
K-Kunisaki!

00:02:27.745 --> 00:02:29.405
You're still here?!

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:33.135
Still here? Where is this place?

00:02:33.685 --> 00:02:35.305
Where's the Chaos Gate?!

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:38.155
Sorry, I don't have time to chat!

00:02:38.855 --> 00:02:41.785
Why do you look like that?

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:44.315
Did you get some weird
curse cast on you?

00:03:00.405 --> 00:03:03.505
Komiyama, why are you alright?

00:03:04.685 --> 00:03:05.845
What is that supposed to mean?

00:03:06.345 --> 00:03:08.285
You know Rena's
member address, right?

00:03:08.785 --> 00:03:09.445
Of course!

00:03:09.585 --> 00:03:12.485
I send her emails every day!

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:13.585
Then...

00:03:13.785 --> 00:03:16.085
Why aren't you infected with the virus?

00:03:16.755 --> 00:03:17.915
Virus?

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.355
Nightfear!

00:03:24.035 --> 00:03:26.155
The Hanged Man!

00:03:30.335 --> 00:03:31.035
Alright!

00:03:31.345 --> 00:03:32.365
Everyone, attack all at once!

00:03:32.545 --> 00:03:33.435
Understood!

00:03:34.715 --> 00:03:35.575
It's no use!

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:36.435
Mireille!

00:03:36.645 --> 00:03:37.665
There's no way we can...

00:03:37.815 --> 00:03:39.075
...defeat that freak of nature.

00:03:39.585 --> 00:03:41.315
We'll all die here!

00:03:41.785 --> 00:03:42.805
Don't give up!

00:03:43.755 --> 00:03:46.155
Everyone's going to die.

00:03:47.025 --> 00:03:48.955
Don't give up on your attacks!

00:03:49.455 --> 00:03:51.395
The creature has to have a weakness!

00:03:53.525 --> 00:03:55.725
Something that tries
to transcend death...

00:03:55.965 --> 00:03:57.435
...would not have any weaknesses.

00:03:57.795 --> 00:03:58.565
Don't give up!

00:04:00.005 --> 00:04:02.905
Rena is... Aura is... fighting.

00:04:04.545 --> 00:04:05.875
Sh-Shugo.

00:04:06.845 --> 00:04:09.105
We can't just give up here!

00:04:10.015 --> 00:04:13.105
But our attacks are having no effect!

00:04:13.515 --> 00:04:15.645
We don't have many items left!

00:04:16.455 --> 00:04:17.645
There's a way!

00:04:18.985 --> 00:04:20.925
What way?

00:04:21.855 --> 00:04:23.845
Data Drain!

00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:26.255
Y-You musn't...

00:04:26.965 --> 00:04:28.125
How foolish.

00:04:28.465 --> 00:04:31.335
If you Data Drain and
Rena is affected...

00:04:31.705 --> 00:04:34.605
...there's a chance that the
virus could hit all at once!

00:04:35.605 --> 00:04:38.265
I never said I was going
to use it on the monster.

00:04:39.375 --> 00:04:41.545
Don't be so rough!

00:04:41.545 --> 00:04:42.405
You're...

00:04:44.175 --> 00:04:45.375
K-Komiyama...

00:04:45.845 --> 00:04:47.475
Of what use is he?

00:04:47.715 --> 00:04:49.275
Huh? Rena!

00:04:50.255 --> 00:04:51.745
Why are you in there?!

00:04:52.285 --> 00:04:53.485
What's wrong!?

00:04:53.825 --> 00:04:57.055
This guy exchanged member
addresses with Rena.

00:04:57.455 --> 00:04:58.615
Despite that...

00:04:59.025 --> 00:05:01.655
...as you can see, he's
not affected by the virus.

00:05:02.665 --> 00:05:04.295
And then I started to think.

00:05:04.805 --> 00:05:07.295
Why he of all people would be alright!

00:05:07.665 --> 00:05:08.795
And I got it!

00:05:09.735 --> 00:05:10.675
It's the Data Drain.

00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:13.845
You were Data Drained.

00:05:14.845 --> 00:05:15.405
Maybe...

00:05:15.775 --> 00:05:18.715
...that's why you're
immune to the virus!

00:05:19.445 --> 00:05:21.935
The possibility... exists.

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:23.075
Shugo...

00:05:23.685 --> 00:05:25.815
...you can't be thinking
of Data Draining us?

00:05:26.185 --> 00:05:26.955
If all goes well...

00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:28.685
...I might be able to weaken...

00:05:29.095 --> 00:05:30.355
...just the virus and remove it.

00:05:30.955 --> 00:05:31.725
And then we'll...

00:05:31.865 --> 00:05:33.725
...have a chance to defeat that thing.

00:05:34.195 --> 00:05:35.685
It's too dangerous!

00:05:36.165 --> 00:05:37.635
That's right.

00:05:38.405 --> 00:05:40.025
I won't Data Drain everyone.

00:05:40.835 --> 00:05:42.265
The only one that will
be Data Drained...

00:05:43.975 --> 00:05:44.965
...will be me.

00:05:46.075 --> 00:05:48.095
Big brother!

00:05:51.245 --> 00:05:51.835
Rena.

00:06:06.895 --> 00:06:09.525
I never want to experience
those memories again.

00:06:11.135 --> 00:06:13.035
If I can't save Rena.

00:06:13.635 --> 00:06:15.565
If I'm not the hero that can save her.

00:06:16.275 --> 00:06:18.065
Then I have no reason
to be in "The World".

00:06:18.945 --> 00:06:20.205
So, death would be better?

00:06:20.505 --> 00:06:21.235
Stupid!

00:06:22.245 --> 00:06:24.105
Is it really that stupid?

00:06:24.575 --> 00:06:26.345
To know death?

00:06:27.685 --> 00:06:28.585
I wish to know.

00:06:29.485 --> 00:06:30.845
That is all.

00:06:36.525 --> 00:06:39.055
Shugo, you're mistaken!

00:06:39.395 --> 00:06:40.155
Wha?

00:06:40.895 --> 00:06:41.765
It's no longer a matter...

00:06:42.035 --> 00:06:43.965
...involving just the two of you.

00:06:44.395 --> 00:06:46.165
It involves the entirety of "The World".

00:06:46.465 --> 00:06:47.695
B-But...

00:06:48.375 --> 00:06:49.355
Shugo.

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.565
You're forgetting the
most important thing.

00:06:52.305 --> 00:06:54.075
Important thing?

00:06:54.475 --> 00:06:55.735
That, you're not the only...

00:06:56.145 --> 00:06:57.635
...one who wants to save Rena.

00:06:58.015 --> 00:06:58.775
That's right!

00:06:58.885 --> 00:07:00.375
Yeah, that's right.

00:07:00.585 --> 00:07:02.745
Otherwise we wouldn't
have come this far.

00:07:03.215 --> 00:07:05.745
No more giving up for me!

00:07:07.225 --> 00:07:08.685
If you're going to Data Drain.

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:10.645
Do it on all of us!

00:07:11.255 --> 00:07:13.595
That will increase the
chances of success!

00:07:14.065 --> 00:07:15.055
Exactly!

00:07:15.735 --> 00:07:16.595
Everyone.

00:07:23.575 --> 00:07:24.305
Shugo!

00:07:27.245 --> 00:07:28.645
Leave this to me!

00:07:28.675 --> 00:07:29.075
Kamui!

00:07:29.775 --> 00:07:31.745
Hurry up with the
Data Drain you guys!

00:07:37.515 --> 00:07:38.145
Shugo!

00:07:38.955 --> 00:07:41.085
If I fail, no hard feelings!

00:07:42.755 --> 00:07:44.085
Shugo.

00:07:45.325 --> 00:07:49.355
Data Drain!

00:08:09.355 --> 00:08:12.445
Balmung, please don't screw this up.

00:08:17.025 --> 00:08:21.015
Wh-What's this?! Oscar!

00:08:22.265 --> 00:08:24.235
We did it! Back to normal!

00:08:24.865 --> 00:08:26.195
My staff too!

00:08:29.805 --> 00:08:30.935
Grunty?

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:34.845
I'm fine. I can fight as well!

00:08:35.945 --> 00:08:38.415
That's right! The fighting's just started.

00:08:41.555 --> 00:08:44.545
Can we win? Just the three of us?

00:08:46.055 --> 00:08:46.855
Shugo...

00:08:48.555 --> 00:08:50.145
There is no such thing...

00:08:50.995 --> 00:08:53.585
...as a monster that
cannot be defeated.

00:08:54.165 --> 00:08:56.095
This is an absolute rule
within "The World".

00:08:57.235 --> 00:08:58.465
Whatever the monster...

00:08:58.935 --> 00:09:00.695
...there's always a way to kill it.

00:09:00.905 --> 00:09:04.565
So... Don't give up until the very end!

00:09:10.315 --> 00:09:12.335
The ultimate party of three.

00:09:14.585 --> 00:09:15.915
Thunder Dance!

00:09:17.685 --> 00:09:19.155
Vak Don!

00:09:25.595 --> 00:09:26.355
Pha Repth!

00:09:29.135 --> 00:09:30.825
Thanks, Hotaru!

00:09:32.205 --> 00:09:34.135
Vak Don! Vak Don!
This is foolish.
Why are they bullying her?

00:09:35.075 --> 00:09:36.675
She and I, we just wanted
to know about "death".

00:09:36.675 --> 00:09:37.575
Thunder Dance!
She and I, we just wanted
to know about "death".

00:09:37.575 --> 00:09:37.905
Thunder Dance!

00:09:37.905 --> 00:09:38.205
Thunder Dance!
That's just all we thought to...

00:09:38.205 --> 00:09:39.795
That's just all we thought to...

00:09:47.615 --> 00:09:48.875
Our attacks are having...

00:09:48.955 --> 00:09:50.215
...absolutely no effect.

00:09:50.955 --> 00:09:52.245
As we thought, this...

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:09.195
If you must use Data Drain...

00:10:09.675 --> 00:10:10.135
Eh?!

00:10:10.875 --> 00:10:13.135
If you must use, Data Drain...

00:10:14.375 --> 00:10:15.305
Must use...

00:10:29.895 --> 00:10:32.155
Shu-Shugo.

00:10:32.595 --> 00:10:33.255
Aura!!

00:10:33.965 --> 00:10:37.865
Shugo.

00:10:40.505 --> 00:10:42.765
If you're going to use the Data Drain...

00:10:43.335 --> 00:10:45.865
When the virus has
completely infected Rena...

00:10:46.245 --> 00:10:48.975
...there will be a moment
before it spreads.

00:10:49.645 --> 00:10:50.475
If you drain it then...

00:10:50.745 --> 00:10:53.275
...you may be able to
drain just the virus.

00:10:54.085 --> 00:10:55.845
But, the time lag is less...

00:10:55.985 --> 00:10:57.815
...than one one-thousandth
of a second.

00:10:59.085 --> 00:11:01.025
Can... I do it?

00:11:01.755 --> 00:11:02.685
It'll be all right.

00:11:04.025 --> 00:11:05.285
You can do it.

00:11:06.425 --> 00:11:07.695
For sure, Shugo.

00:11:11.835 --> 00:11:12.805
I'll get you back.

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:14.025
I swear!

00:11:21.345 --> 00:11:27.175
Data... Drain!

00:11:27.745 --> 00:11:29.805
Shugo!

00:11:30.755 --> 00:11:33.115
Rena!

00:11:48.605 --> 00:11:49.125
Rena!

00:11:58.315 --> 00:11:59.245
Shugo!

00:11:59.785 --> 00:12:00.335
Rena!

00:12:06.055 --> 00:12:07.025
How dare you do that!

00:12:10.495 --> 00:12:12.925
Death to all player characters.

00:12:13.525 --> 00:12:15.055
Death to this world.

00:12:16.535 --> 00:12:18.235
Hyper Thunder Dance!

00:12:18.235 --> 00:12:18.335
No!!!
Hyper Thunder Dance!

00:12:18.335 --> 00:12:19.355
No!!!

00:12:42.055 --> 00:12:43.555
Shugo!

00:12:43.555 --> 00:12:44.115
Rena!!

00:12:47.825 --> 00:12:49.625
No!

00:12:54.505 --> 00:12:55.095
Those are...

00:12:55.875 --> 00:12:56.925
Chaos Gates.

00:12:57.375 --> 00:12:58.495
W-Why?

00:12:58.805 --> 00:13:01.935
It's running. The final trap.

00:13:02.945 --> 00:13:04.245
The final trap?

00:13:39.915 --> 00:13:41.975
Systems going down in five minutes...

00:13:42.855 --> 00:13:43.315
Why?

00:13:46.685 --> 00:13:49.715
It creates a limitless
amount of corrupted data.

00:13:50.295 --> 00:13:52.525
It will continue to bury "The World"...

00:13:52.925 --> 00:13:54.555
...until it collapses.

00:13:55.135 --> 00:13:57.655
In order to destroy
any and all evidence.

00:13:57.835 --> 00:13:59.195
W-Why?

00:14:00.335 --> 00:14:02.395
This town is freaky...

00:14:02.575 --> 00:14:04.475
...the user's manual
never mentioned this.

00:14:04.735 --> 00:14:07.265
Rena! We have to log out, quickly!

00:14:09.315 --> 00:14:10.505
All the gates are being used...

00:14:10.915 --> 00:14:14.475
...to spread the destructive
data in "The World".

00:14:14.945 --> 00:14:16.715
Logout is impossible.

00:14:17.185 --> 00:14:18.175
Who is that girl?

00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:20.315
The fourth child.

00:14:21.525 --> 00:14:23.585
One of the children that
started this incident.

00:14:23.825 --> 00:14:27.055
But, I heard it was a
group of three boys.

00:14:27.565 --> 00:14:29.355
But, when I looked into it...

00:14:29.935 --> 00:14:31.485
...with three people
would have been difficult.

00:14:32.265 --> 00:14:34.035
Four people would work better.

00:14:34.835 --> 00:14:35.565
You...

00:14:35.805 --> 00:14:38.365
...were used by the
wandering Al as well?

00:14:39.675 --> 00:14:40.735
Maybe not.

00:14:42.315 --> 00:14:44.245
I met her and developed
an interest in her.

00:14:44.515 --> 00:14:46.345
She who was born from...

00:14:47.085 --> 00:14:48.815
...lingering remnants of...

00:14:49.085 --> 00:14:50.985
...incompletely deleted data...

00:14:51.355 --> 00:14:54.445
...and drifts of buggy data.

00:14:55.195 --> 00:14:57.925
If only she could answer my questions.

00:14:58.125 --> 00:14:59.185
What are you talking about?

00:14:59.625 --> 00:15:03.115
She and I had been
thinking about "death".

00:15:10.405 --> 00:15:12.275
I had searched in the real world...

00:15:12.845 --> 00:15:15.335
...but I could not find
a definitive answer.

00:15:16.075 --> 00:15:16.975
That's why.

00:15:18.585 --> 00:15:23.275
Together, we experimented
in "The World".

00:15:24.315 --> 00:15:28.055
However, we didn't learn
anything of significance.

00:15:29.055 --> 00:15:32.025
Even going as far as to
use the apoptosis virus.

00:15:37.695 --> 00:15:40.165
If there was one thing we learned...

00:15:41.065 --> 00:15:43.565
...it was that "death"
was just like "deletion".

00:15:45.075 --> 00:15:45.865
That's not right!

00:15:46.645 --> 00:15:48.765
If you really thought that way.

00:15:49.215 --> 00:15:52.045
Then why did you make that world...

00:15:52.485 --> 00:15:53.445
...that was like an afterlife?

00:15:56.155 --> 00:15:57.115
Isn't it because you thought.

00:15:57.355 --> 00:15:59.445
It would be nice to have something...

00:15:59.725 --> 00:16:01.315
...like an afterlife somewhere?

00:16:01.955 --> 00:16:04.485
We've experienced that too.

00:16:05.055 --> 00:16:05.685
The desire for...

00:16:05.895 --> 00:16:07.825
...a place to go after death.

00:16:09.535 --> 00:16:11.085
Someone once said...

00:16:11.595 --> 00:16:12.865
...that death is like parting.

00:16:15.035 --> 00:16:16.075
But...

00:16:16.075 --> 00:16:18.125
People who are separated
from each other...

00:16:18.705 --> 00:16:21.105
...have a chance to
meet in "The World".

00:16:21.675 --> 00:16:22.705
There may be a place...

00:16:22.875 --> 00:16:24.675
...like that where we can meet with...

00:16:24.815 --> 00:16:26.545
...those that have passed away!

00:16:28.585 --> 00:16:29.915
I may have wanted to...

00:16:30.155 --> 00:16:32.015
...believe that somewhere in my mind.

00:16:32.825 --> 00:16:34.915
Although I don't understand it.

00:16:36.295 --> 00:16:39.055
She who knows not death...

00:16:39.395 --> 00:16:41.985
...she who sacrificed herself for me.

00:16:42.895 --> 00:16:44.265
And is no longer in this world.

00:16:44.995 --> 00:16:47.525
She might have seen that place.

00:16:48.265 --> 00:16:50.825
But, it's already too late...

00:16:52.045 --> 00:16:54.635
"The World" will collapse soon.

00:16:55.205 --> 00:16:56.905
Collapse? What about us?

00:16:57.715 --> 00:16:58.835
I don't know.

00:16:59.045 --> 00:17:00.775
Will we really die or...

00:17:01.085 --> 00:17:03.175
...be in an eternal slumber?

00:17:03.815 --> 00:17:04.685
Come to think of it...

00:17:05.055 --> 00:17:07.855
...someone compared
death to an eternal sleep.

00:17:08.955 --> 00:17:10.085
Is that all right with you?

00:17:10.555 --> 00:17:11.715
Is that really all right?

00:17:19.265 --> 00:17:20.895
It's too soon to quit!

00:17:22.205 --> 00:17:23.065
There's still one unsolved...

00:17:23.775 --> 00:17:25.435
...mystery here.

00:17:25.905 --> 00:17:27.735
Mystery?

00:17:28.075 --> 00:17:29.545
Why did Aura not only
bring back Shugo...

00:17:30.045 --> 00:17:31.135
...As Kite...

00:17:31.515 --> 00:17:34.175
But also Rena as BlackRose?

00:17:34.745 --> 00:17:35.645
It must be!?

00:17:35.715 --> 00:17:36.945
Shugo and Rena.

00:17:37.555 --> 00:17:39.675
There must be a reason
for both of them.

00:17:40.155 --> 00:17:41.175
Maybe if they're together...

00:17:41.655 --> 00:17:43.925
...some kind of power will be released.

00:17:49.335 --> 00:17:50.355
The Bracelet.

00:17:50.395 --> 00:17:51.525
Eh?

00:17:51.635 --> 00:17:54.225
If there is such a power...

00:17:54.705 --> 00:17:56.895
The key to it would be the bracelet.

00:17:57.605 --> 00:17:59.735
The thing that the girl
feared the most was...

00:18:00.005 --> 00:18:01.035
...that bracelet.

00:18:02.545 --> 00:18:03.805
This bracelet?

00:18:26.905 --> 00:18:27.565
Shugo.

00:18:29.205 --> 00:18:29.665
Rena.

00:18:48.925 --> 00:18:49.415
I...

00:18:50.095 --> 00:18:51.525
...think I finally understand.

00:18:52.095 --> 00:18:53.025
Me too.

00:19:16.515 --> 00:19:17.585
Let's go Rena.

00:19:17.585 --> 00:19:19.515
Shugo.

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:21.045
Our world...

00:19:21.085 --> 00:19:22.215
"The World"!

00:19:22.495 --> 00:19:23.885
We'll protect it!

00:19:25.225 --> 00:19:28.665
We're counting on you Shugo, Rena!

00:19:46.585 --> 00:19:52.175
Shugo! Rena!

00:20:03.735 --> 00:20:14.165
Hashitteyuku kodomotachi
no hashagu warai koe ni
In the running children's
frolicking voices

00:20:14.545 --> 00:20:22.075
Hikari to kage oikakete mitaku naru
They want to chase
the light and shadows

00:20:25.355 --> 00:20:35.825
Midori no ha ni sukashite
mita ano taiyou no saki ni
Watching the sun shine
between the green leaves,

00:20:36.135 --> 00:20:44.905
Nani ga aru to omotteita no darou
wondering if something is there.

00:20:46.245 --> 00:20:56.445
Emerald Green hana wo
tsunda te no naka kara
From inside the hands picking,
the emerald green flowers

00:20:56.885 --> 00:21:07.385
Sora kaze tsuchi e to
sugata wo kaeteyuku
change their body to the
sky, the wind, the ground.

00:21:07.665 --> 00:21:19.595
Sono utsukushisa ni me wo
hiraita mabushi sugiru basho de
Laying in that opulent place that
opened its eyes to that beauty,

00:21:19.945 --> 00:21:27.505
Nekoronda sora ni toikaketeru
Asking questions to the sky

00:21:34.725 --> 00:21:37.625
Ta-dah! I've gotten ahold of it!

00:21:38.095 --> 00:21:40.185
Look, look, look!

00:21:40.465 --> 00:21:42.455
Three sets of rare items!

00:21:42.735 --> 00:21:44.785
Who would wear those?

00:21:44.865 --> 00:21:46.055
Ah, Kamui.

00:21:46.135 --> 00:21:47.655
Ah... Long time!

00:21:48.235 --> 00:21:50.365
Everyone is here, right?

00:21:51.005 --> 00:21:52.135
Are we going somewhere?

00:21:52.905 --> 00:21:54.775
There appears to be
an event of some sort.

00:21:55.275 --> 00:21:56.305
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:21:57.475 --> 00:21:59.445
It's going to be an
incredible event today.

00:21:59.685 --> 00:22:03.115
Could it be, a project by Balmung?

00:22:03.455 --> 00:22:05.615
Ew.

00:22:05.925 --> 00:22:08.715
It'll be all right.
I made sure to check it.

00:22:12.695 --> 00:22:15.525
The two most important
people are not here yet.

00:22:15.995 --> 00:22:17.025
It's all right.

00:22:17.095 --> 00:22:18.255
They'll be here soon.

00:22:19.805 --> 00:22:21.665
After all, the only place...

00:22:21.735 --> 00:22:22.965
...where the two of them can meet...

00:22:23.075 --> 00:22:25.235
...without regards to distance
and time is "The World".

00:22:25.275 --> 00:22:25.935
This is...

00:22:26.145 --> 00:22:28.305
..."The World" that the
two of them protected.

00:22:31.415 --> 00:22:32.605
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:22:34.215 --> 00:22:35.345
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:22:36.055 --> 00:22:36.685
They're here!

00:22:36.685 --> 00:22:38.415
You look well, everyone!

00:22:38.415 --> 00:22:39.515
Yes!

00:22:39.985 --> 00:22:41.425
Tres Bien!

00:22:41.725 --> 00:22:42.985
I'm itching to fight!

00:22:43.055 --> 00:22:45.425
Shall we go train, Shugo?

00:22:45.425 --> 00:22:47.065
Yes! Sanjuro!

00:22:47.065 --> 00:22:48.525
It's all right to train...

00:22:48.595 --> 00:22:50.535
...but don't forget about me, y'know.

00:22:50.595 --> 00:22:51.725
Of course not!

00:22:51.865 --> 00:22:54.095
We won't ever be separated again.

00:22:54.335 --> 00:22:56.565
"The World" is... This place is...

00:22:56.705 --> 00:22:58.835
A place where we can
always meet again.

00:22:59.645 --> 00:23:01.605
If your heart desires it.

00:23:02.245 --> 00:23:04.575
It's a place where you
can always meet again...

00:23:05.275 --> 00:23:06.335
Let's go!

00:23:06.385 --> 00:23:09.745
The legendary heroes are back!
